	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p>Your mastery of the ki flowing through you purges poison and disease and sustains your body.</p><ul><li><p>You are immune to &amp;reference[disease] and poison, including &amp;reference[poison] damage and the &amp;reference[Poisoned apply=false] condition.</p></li><li><p>You suffer none of the frailty of old age. You can still die of old age, however.</p></li><li><p>You can't be aged magically.</p></li><li><p>You no longer need food or water.</p></li></ul>",
			"chat": ""
		},
